# Copy to `.env` for local dev, and set the same var in Vercel →
# Project → Settings → Environment Variables.
#
# Web3Forms access key for the contact form. Free, email-only signup at
# https://web3forms.com — paste your inbox address, confirm, copy the key.
# It only authorises "send an email to that one inbox", so it's fine in the
# client bundle. Without it the contact form shows an error state.
VITE_WEB3FORMS_KEY=
